{#- modules/identity/spec-sprawl.j2
    One slide: the agent identity / authorization spec landscape as a wall of
    names, to make the point that AAuth, DPoP, EMA and A2A cards are a handful
    among dozens. Names are shortened from the documents' titles; nothing here
    is invented. Checked 23 Oct 2026 against:

      OpenID AuthZEN WG — https://openid.net/wg/authzen/specifications/
        Authorization API 1.0 (Final, Jan 2026); working group drafts: COAZ
        Framework 1.0, COAZ-MCP Binding 1.0, Access Request and Approval
        Profile 1.0, Obligations Profile 1.0.
      IETF OAuth WG — https://datatracker.ietf.org/wg/oauth/documents/
        draft-ietf-oauth-v2-1, -identity-assertion-authz-grant (ID-JAG),
        -transaction-tokens, -identity-chaining (RFC Ed queue),
        -client-id-metadata-document, -attestation-based-client-auth,
        -spiffe-client-auth, -deferred-token-response, -first-party-apps.
      IETF WIMSE WG — https://datatracker.ietf.org/wg/wimse/documents/
        draft-ietf-wimse-arch, -identifier, -wpt, -http-signature,
        -mutual-tls, -workload-creds, -aims.
      Individual Internet-Drafts (not WG-adopted), all on datatracker:
        draft-hardt-oauth-aauth-protocol, draft-hardt-aauth-{r3,budgets,events,
        bootstrap}, draft-hamr-oauth-agent-delegation, draft-mishra-oauth-agent-
        grants, draft-mw-oauth-actor-chain, draft-mcguinness-oauth-{actor-profile,
        actor-proofs,actor-receipts,mission,ai-agent-instance}, draft-chen-oauth-
        agent-{intent-token,revocation,authz-use-cases}, draft-niyikiza-oauth-
        attenuating-agent-tokens, draft-araut-oauth-transaction-tokens-for-agents,
        draft-jia-oauth-scope-aggregation, draft-jiang-oauth-intent-admission,
        draft-watts-oauth-agent-revocation-closure, draft-alla-agent-identity-
        document, draft-jovancevic-saip, draft-pidlisnyi-aps, draft-sharif-x509-
        agent-identity-profile, draft-sharif-openid-agent-identity, draft-nelson-
        agent-delegation-receipts, draft-schrock-ep-{authorization-receipts,quorum},
        draft-ni-wimse-ai-agent-identity, draft-sweeney-wimse-credential-delegation,
        draft-kavian-agent-enrollment-protocol, draft-narvaneni-agent-uri,
        draft-sato-soos-mjwt, draft-saha-aadp, draft-oauth-ai-agents-on-behalf-of-
        user (expired).
      "50+": a datatracker search for active drafts named "agent" is capped at
      200 results and hits the cap.

    Primitive-native. Import WITH CONTEXT.
      {%- from "modules/identity/spec-sprawl.j2" import more_specs with context %}
-#}

{%- from "modules/branding/" ~ branding ~ "/primitives.j2" import content_slide, slide_heading -%}

{%- macro more_specs() -%}
{%- call content_slide("50+ more specs") %}
<style>
  .sp { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr 1fr 3.1fr; gap: 1.5rem 2rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  .sp h5 { margin: 0 0 .6rem; font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase;
           color: var(--accent-primary); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--slide-hairline); padding-bottom: .4rem; }
  .sp ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--slide-ink-2); }
  .sp li { padding-left: 1rem; text-indent: -1rem; }
  .sp li::before { content: "\2022"; color: var(--slide-ink-3); margin-right: .55rem; }
  .sp .wide ul { columns: 3; column-gap: 1.75rem; }
  .sp .wide li { break-inside: avoid; }
  .sp .muted { color: var(--slide-ink-3); }
</style>
{{ slide_heading("", "and 50+ more possible specs?!") }}
<div class="sp">
  {%- set cols = [
    ("OpenID AuthZEN", "", [
      "Authorization API 1.0", "COAZ Framework", "COAZ-MCP Binding",
      "Access Request &amp; Approval", "Obligations Profile"]),
    ("IETF OAuth WG", "", [
      "OAuth 2.1", "ID-JAG", "Transaction Tokens", "Identity &amp; Authz Chaining",
      "Client ID Metadata Document", "Attestation Client Auth", "SPIFFE Client Auth",
      "Deferred Token Response", "First-Party Apps"]),
    ("IETF WIMSE WG", "", [
      "WIMSE Architecture", "Workload Identifier", "Workload Proof Token", "HTTP Signatures",
      "Mutual TLS", "Workload Credentials", "AI Identity Management System"]),
    ("Individual drafts", "wide", [
      "AAuth + R3, Budgets, Events", "Attenuated Agent Delegation", "Delegated AI Agent Authz",
      "OAuth Actor Chain", "Actor Profile, Proofs, Receipts", "Mission-Bound Authorization",
      "Intent Token", "Attenuating Agent Tokens", "Transaction Tokens for Agents",
      "Scope Aggregation", "Agent Revocation Closure", "On-Behalf-Of for AI Agents",
      "Agent Identity Document", "Signed Agent Identity Protocol", "Agent Passport System",
      "X.509 Agent Identity Profile", "OIDC Agent Identity Claims", "Agent Enrollment Protocol",
      "Mandate JWT", "Agent Delegation Receipts", "Authorization Receipts",
      "Multi-Party Quorum Authz", "WIMSE for AI Agents", "Credential Delegation for Agents",
      "<span class=\"muted\">&hellip;</span>"]),
  ] %}
  {%- for title, cls, items in cols %}
  <div class="{{ cls }}"><h5>{{ title }}</h5><ul>
    {%- for it in items %}<li>{{ it }}</li>{% endfor %}
  </ul></div>
  {%- endfor %}
</div>
{%- endcall %}
{%- endmacro -%}
